    "basement":
      "That's the place you are standing at the moment. Just have a "
      "look, if you want to know more about this place.\n",
    "this level":
      "That's the place you are standing at the moment. Just have a "
      "look, if you want to know more about this place.\n",
    "room":
      "That's the place you are standing at the moment. Just have a "
      "look, if you want to know more about this place.\n",
    "end":
      "That's the place you are standing at the moment. Just have a "
